<title>USA: General Instrument Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>General Instrument Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr dil profit	   $0.30     loss	 $0.33</p>
<p> Net profit		42,122     loss	40,892</p>
<p> Revs		     662,122		  563,251</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 quarter includes $90 million after tax charge related to acqusiition and write-off of technology. Excluding the charge, earnings were $0.37 a diluted share.  </p>
<p>	  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr dil profit	   $0.12   profit	 $0.57</p>
<p> Net			 15,199		   70,215</p>
<p> Revs		   1,953,072		1,783,606</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluing onetime $91.7 million after-tax charge for litigation, nine months 1996 earnings were $0.79 fully diluted.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
